        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They demand a sacrifice to save the world. You will save her, and let the world end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy a world-ending prophecy in <strong>Forbidden Offering</strong>, a frantic,  rogue-lite bullet heaven. As the young witch March, you'll carve a path through relentless hordes to protect Lenore, a girl whose immolation is said to be the only thing preventing reality from falling apart completely. Their perilous journey to the Last Horizon Threshold will test their bond and uncover the true, terrifying extent of Lenore's power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/92e2505981bafc6feeb7c3f511e56005.poster.avif?t=1752801456\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/92e2505981bafc6feeb7c3f511e56005.webm?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/92e2505981bafc6feeb7c3f511e56005.mp4?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield Devastating Duo-Magic:</strong> Unleash an arsenal of unique spells as March, and combine them with Lenore's mysterious powers to create screen-clearing combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a World in Pieces:</strong> Traverse through hauntingly beautiful biomes. No two runs are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Your Power:</strong> Discover ancient relics and unlock forbidden knowledge to permanently enhance your abilities, transforming you from a defiant witch into an apocalyptic force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bond Forged in Chaos:</strong> The unbreakable bond between March and Lenore is your key to survival. Her unique support in the heat of battle is essential to withstanding the encroaching darkness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/ddc89e2e274c3903547eb7396905dfa8.poster.avif?t=1752801456\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/ddc89e2e274c3903547eb7396905dfa8.webm?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/ddc89e2e274c3903547eb7396905dfa8.mp4?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your world rests in your hands, and your actions may doom it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you defy destiny and embrace the end, or will the darkness consume all?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They demand a sacrifice to save the world. You will save her, and let the world end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy a world-ending prophecy in <strong>Forbidden Offering</strong>, a frantic,  rogue-lite bullet heaven. As the young witch March, you'll carve a path through relentless hordes to protect Lenore, a girl whose immolation is said to be the only thing preventing reality from falling apart completely. Their perilous journey to the Last Horizon Threshold will test their bond and uncover the true, terrifying extent of Lenore's power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/92e2505981bafc6feeb7c3f511e56005.poster.avif?t=1752801456\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/92e2505981bafc6feeb7c3f511e56005.webm?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/92e2505981bafc6feeb7c3f511e56005.mp4?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield Devastating Duo-Magic:</strong> Unleash an arsenal of unique spells as March, and combine them with Lenore's mysterious powers to create screen-clearing combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a World in Pieces:</strong> Traverse through hauntingly beautiful biomes. No two runs are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Your Power:</strong> Discover ancient relics and unlock forbidden knowledge to permanently enhance your abilities, transforming you from a defiant witch into an apocalyptic force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bond Forged in Chaos:</strong> The unbreakable bond between March and Lenore is your key to survival. Her unique support in the heat of battle is essential to withstanding the encroaching darkness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/ddc89e2e274c3903547eb7396905dfa8.poster.avif?t=1752801456\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/ddc89e2e274c3903547eb7396905dfa8.webm?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067680/extras/ddc89e2e274c3903547eb7396905dfa8.mp4?t=1752801456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your world rests in your hands, and your actions may doom it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you defy destiny and embrace the end, or will the darkness consume all?</strong></p>",
